#HELPS
1 EBONHEART~
Ebonheart is the heart of Imperial authority and government across Vvardenfell
where the Duke and Grand Council rule from a vast keep guarded by legionaries.
Chapels, foreign missions and company warehouses all line the fortified harbor
as soldiers protect the docks and halls of provincial power.~
